Peyda da

899
00:55:26,912 --> 00:55:28,192
zannedersem

900
00:55:28,192 --> 00:55:29,292
Farsça.

901
00:55:29,652 --> 00:55:30,512
Burada nereler

902
00:55:30,512 --> 00:55:31,852
Türkçe diye sorarsanız

903
00:55:31,852 --> 00:55:32,271
bana

904
00:55:32,271 --> 00:55:32,912
Dur

905
00:55:32,912 --> 00:55:33,412
Selin,

906
00:55:33,672 --> 00:55:33,912
Dur

907
